  "content": "\n\n<h1>由 Coffee 制作的原版风格 PBR 材质包</h1>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><strong>前置要求：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>OptiFine 或 Iris Shaders</em></strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>请确认您的光影包是否支持 LabPBR</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>请选择支持 PBR 功能的光影包，例如 Nostalgia Shaders、BSL Shaders 或 Kappa Shaders。</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><em><strong>如果您喜欢我制作的材质包，可以考虑赞助我一杯饮品，以支持 CoffeePBR 材质包的长期更新。您可以通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fifdian.net%252fa%252fCoffeeXiaoGuan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ifdian（爱发电）</a> 赞助我。</strong></em></h2>\n<h1><em><strong>希望大家喜欢我的材质包</strong></em></h1>\n<p><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8540790b-ece9-4836-8167-c4e958238f1a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_71ea77b4-ee21-4214-b413-2ee7b44ec729.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45bcbfd9-8ac1-4b3e-b687-89b1e6b628f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9f8eb26-8c3b-42cc-bec0-48cac661c730.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9560c0a3-b1c8-4d40-acba-2cda351e175f.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></em></p>",
